    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "육식",
        "summary": "초가스는 유닛을 죽이면 체력과 마나를 회복합니다. 회복량은 초가스의 레벨이 높아질수록 증가합니다.",
        "tooltip": "적 유닛을 처치할 때마다 체력을 <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">18</span>, 마나를 <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">4.72</span> 회복합니다."
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Carnivore",
        "summary": "Whenever Cho'Gath kills a unit, he recovers Health and Mana. The values restored increase with Cho'Gath's level.",
        "tooltip": "Killing an enemy restores <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">18</span> Health and <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">4.72</span> Mana."
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "肉食者",
        "summary": "当科加斯杀死一个单位时，他会回复生命值和法力值。回复的数值会随着科加斯的等级而提升。",
        "tooltip": "击杀一名敌人会回复<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">18</span>生命值和<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">4.72</span>法力值。"
      }
    }
  }
